OL,3,GNEWSAM27 shut Fareham-Portsmouth after
OL,4,Amotorcycle crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA stretch of the M27 eastbound has been
OL,7,Fclosed following a crash.
OL,9,FThe motorway is shut between junction
OL,10,F11 for Fareham and junction 12 for
OL,11,FPortsmouth. Lane three on the westbound
OL,12,Fcarriageway is also closed.
OL,14,FNational Highways said the crash
OL,15,Finvolving a motorcycle happened at
OL,16,Fabout 06:45 BST.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
