OL,3,GNEWSAM27 shut Fareham-Portsmouth after
OL,4,Amotorcycle crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FTraffic is being diverted off eastbound
OL,7,Fat junction 11 and on to the A27
OL,8,Ftowards Fareham. Drivers are being
OL,9,Furged to allow extra time for their
OL,10,Fjourney, re-route or even delay their
OL,11,Ftrip.
